    for geolocation data for each domain.

    Parameters:
    - text (str): input text possibly containing URLs.
    - pause_between_requests (float): seconds to sleep between successive IP API requests
        (useful to avoid rate limits; default 0.0).
    - timeout (float): timeout in seconds for HTTP requests to the IP API.

    Returns:
